# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This branch tracks ONLY the C++ estimator and its EuRoC configurations.
#
# It shares a working tree with the private research repository, which also
# holds datasets, evaluation results, manuscripts and third-party reference
# implementations. None of that belongs here, so the rule is a whitelist:
# ignore everything, then re-admit exactly the two things this branch is for.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!cpp_gtsam_vio/
!cpp_gtsam_vio/**

# ... but never build output, data, or run artefacts living inside it
cpp_gtsam_vio/build/
cpp_gtsam_vio/results*/
cpp_gtsam_vio/temp_configs/
cpp_gtsam_vio/benchmark/
cpp_gtsam_vio/logs/
cpp_gtsam_vio/*.log
cpp_gtsam_vio/support_files/*.bin
*.o
*.d
